---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Contact SSEGU" description="Contact the SSEGU team.">
  <div class="shell prose-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Get in touch</p>
    <h1>Contact SSEGU</h1>
    <p>
      Use the email address below for editorial questions, corrections, partnership or advertising
      enquiries, privacy requests, and questions about SSEGU Work.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href="mailto:africa.is.so.rich@gmail.com">africa.is.so.rich@gmail.com</a>
    </p>
    <h2>Corrections and feedback</h2>
    <p>
      If you believe an article contains a material error, include the article link, the specific
      point in question and any supporting source. We review corrections in context and may update
      or annotate published material where appropriate.
    </p>
    <h2>Employer enquiries</h2>
    <p>
      Employers can use the <a href="/work/submit-job/">SSEGU Work job submission form</a> for
      vacancy details. Submissions are reviewed privately and are not published automatically.
    </p>
    <p class="prose-note">SSEGU is based in Uganda. Response times may vary.</p>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
